### =================================================================
### HABIT TRACKER RPG - MANUAL BACKEND API TEST SCENARIOS
### =================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api

### Scenario 1: Check server root status
GET http://localhost:5001/
Accept: application/json

###

### Scenario 2: Authenticate using the demo account
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "password"
}

### Capture token from login response
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Scenario 3: Fetch active player stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/player
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Scenario 4: Fetch active habits
GET {{baseUrl}}/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Scenario 5: Create a new custom habit
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mindfulness Meditation",
  "description": "10 minutes of morning silence",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "frequency": "daily"
}

###

### Scenario 6: Complete habit with ID 1 (Workout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Scenario 7: Fetch available rewards in the shop
GET {{baseUrl}}/rewards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json